130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 74 0 R
/T (WikiLLM takes a different approach by converting documents into a structured, interconnected knowledge base. It automatically extracts entities, concepts, facts, definitions, relationships, and summaries, organizing them into linked wiki-style pages. Instead of retrieving disconnected text chunks, WikiLLM retrieves related knowledge pages and their connections, enabling better context understanding, improved reasoning, reduced retrieval redundancy, and more accurate answers to complex queries.)
/E (WikiLLM takes a different approach by converting documents into a structured, interconnected knowledge base. It automatically extracts entities, concepts, facts, definitions, relationships, and summaries, organizing them into linked wiki-style pages. Instead of retrieving disconnected text chunks, WikiLLM retrieves related knowledge pages and their connections, enabling better context understanding, improved reasoning, reduced retrieval redundancy, and more accurate answers to complex queries.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [14]
>>
